      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeepSeek-V4 decodes garbage on ROCm GPUs other than gfx942/gfx950. Prefill is fine. Affects every arch on the fallback kernel (gfx11, gfx12, …). Tested on gfx1151 only.\n\n#57435 folded the inverse RoPE into the split-K sparse decode reduce, and `rocm_sparse_attn_decode` now returns how many rows it already rotated so `forward_mqa` can skip them. But only gfx942/gfx950 run that split-K reduce. Every other arch takes the fallback kernel, which never applies the inverse RoPE, yet the function still reports every row as rotated. Those rows never get rotated.\n\nThis PR reports rotated rows only when the split-K reduce ran. Nothing changes on gfx942/gfx950.\n\nTests: a new arch-agnostic test checks that the fused path plus the caller's pass matches the unfused path.\n\n## Duplicate-work check\n\nSearched open PRs for `rocm_sparse_attn_decode` and `inv_rope_positions`. No duplicate. #60154 and #61967 change the gfx942/gfx950 decode paths, not this return value.\n\n## Test Result\n\n`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731` on 2× Strix Halo / gfx1151, TP=2, ROCm nightly wheel, `--enforce-eager`, greedy.\n\n**Before:**\n\n```\n\"What is the capital of France?\"\n-> We need answer (1) \\n\"**） * ... (so Paris</think> ** ( ) ) **\n\n5 prompts with checkable answers: 1/5\n```\n\n**After:**\n\n```\n\"What is the capital of France?\"\n-> We need answer simple. Capital of France is Paris. One short sentence.</think>The capital of France is Paris.\n\n5 prompts with checkable answers: 5/5\nGSM8K, first 25: 25/25\n```\n\n**`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017`** (TP=4 over 4× gfx1151, main @ 39983a5e7): DeepSeek-V4.1 decode calls the same function with `inv_rope_positions`, and needs this fix too.\n\n```\n                                     before   after\n5 prompts with checkable answers     5/5      5/5\nGSM8K, first 25                      1/25     25/25\n```\n\n```\npytest tests/kernels/attention/test_rocm_triton_attn_dsv4.py   (gfx1151)\n  before: 1 failed (the new test), 56 passed, 74 skipped\n  after:  57 passed, 74 skipped\n```\n\n## AI assistance\n\nAI assistance was used for this change. The submitting human has reviewed every changed line and ran the tests reported above.\n\n",
